# Policy: binaries that exist in the upstream Mercurial repository are kept and
# published as-is. Binaries we generate are never committed; the build
# regenerates them. One named exception: src/clib.lib. See doc/publishing.md.

# --- Ported from the upstream .hgignore ---------------------------------
# Upstream also ignores tools/o3pack.exe, but tracks the file anyway (hg
# ignores only untracked files). We keep the tracked upstream copy, so that
# entry is deliberately not ported.
tools/o3_tiny.hex
tools/crop_ostc3_hex_büro.bat
tools/o3pack_büro.bat
hwos.X*
src/Tests/build/

# --- Local tooling noise, never upstream --------------------------------
__pycache__/
tools/build_hwos.remote.conf

# --- Build output we generate -------------------------------------------
build/

# --- Named exception ----------------------------------------------------
# Microchip's precompiled C18 runtime library. Not a build input: the build
# resolves it from the C18 installation (tools/build_hwos.ps1).
src/clib.lib
